     "notes": [
      "The Australian government's Go Global Toolkit is a trade market intelligence, information and export capability platform that is available for Australian exporters, including women entrepreneurs, to access 24/7. The Toolkit contains information and insights on how to assess, find and prepare products or services for new markets.\n\nSupport is provided through practical measures that improve export capability and reduce friction at the border. This includes digital trade facilitation work through Asia-Pacific Economic Cooperation (APEC), including Australia's support for the Principles for the Interoperability of Electronic Invoicing Systems, as well as trade information services such as the Free Trade Agreement (FTA) Portal. "
     ]
