      "Chile implements general programmes that include women and contribute to strengthening their participation in digital trade, although \"Digitaliza tu Pyme\" is not a women-only programme and is not exclusively targeted at women in digital trade.\n\"Digitaliza tu Pyme\", led by the Ministry of Economy, Development and Tourism, supports MSMEs through digital maturity diagnosis, training pathways, technical assistance, access to digital tools and coordination with public and private partners. Its current strategy incorporates gender as a cross-cutting inclusion criterion, together with equity, territorial relevance and progressive support. This allows the programme to identify and address gaps affecting women entrepreneurs within the broader MSME population.\nThe programme uses \"Chequeo Digital\", an online self-assessment tool, to measure firms' digital maturity and guide them toward relevant support. This helps identify differences by sex, sector, territory and firm characteristics, and supports better targeting of training and assistance related to e-commerce, digital payments, digital marketing, cybersecurity, business management tools and technology adoption.\nIn addition, Chile's broader innovation and entrepreneurship ecosystem includes complementary instruments with a specific focus on women-led businesses. Corfo has opened \"Inicia\" and \"Expande\" calls for innovative ventures led by women, supporting projects from early validation stages to expansion into new markets. Start-Up Chile, Corfo's public startup accelerator, also includes the \"Female Founder Factor\" initiative, which seeks to empower women in the entrepreneurial ecosystem and is connected to programmes such as \"Build\", \"Ignite\" and \"Growth\" through gender-focused measures.\nThese complementary instruments are not exclusively digital trade programmes, but they can support women-led firms and startups whose business models use digital technologies, e-commerce, platforms, online services or scalable digital solutions.\nRelevant references:\n•\tDigitaliza tu Pyme: www.digitalizatupyme.cl\n•\tChequeo Digital: www.chequeodigital.cl\n•\tCorfo: www.corfo.cl\n•\tStart-Up Chile: www.startupchile.org"
