     "main": "",
     "notes": [
      "The Dominican Republic offers training opportunities to strengthen women's participation in digital trade through initiatives led by ProDominicana and its international partners. One notable example is the collaboration between ProDominicana, the International Trade Centre (ITC) and the SheTrades Initiative, which delivers training through the ecomConnect programme.\nThe SheTrades-ecomConnect programme is designed to help women-led businesses sell their products online and expand into domestic and international markets. Through virtual learning resources, practical guidance and ongoing support, participants strengthen their capacity to use e-commerce as a channel for internationalization. The programme also provides access to a network of women entrepreneurs, facilitating peer learning, business networking and the exchange of experiences.\nReferences:\n•\nhttps://prodominicana.gob.do/shetrades#trainings\n•\nhttps://market.ecomconnect.org/ecomconnect-programme/"
     ]
