      "Egypt: Activities are implemented by MCIT, MSMEDA and the National Council for Women to provide women entrepreneurs with training in digital marketing, e-commerce, ICT skills and online business development, with the explicit aim of increasing market access and export opportunities. Rwanda: Supporting a more inclusive digital entrepreneurship ecoystem, with a focus also on women youth (URL: https://www.ilo.org/publications/digital-entrepreneurship-ecosystem-assessment-youth-kigali-and-musanze); Indonesia:  Through the PROMISE II Impact programme, ILO has supported digital finance solutions for MSMEs, and has recently also begun a process to support rural banks in better serving women entrepreneurs. ",
